{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24811","headline":"浊水求珠 · 王起","name":"浊水求珠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"行潦沈明月，光辉也不浮。\n识珍能洞鉴，精宝此来求。\n几被泥沙杂，常随混浊流。\n润川终自媚，照乘且何由。\n的皪终难掩，晶荧愿见收。\n蛇行无胫至，饮德已闻酬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24811.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24811","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}